  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook corn and half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 minutes, then remove from heat. Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507bf2bafce28d3c35d8c35-c3174c92.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Trim and halve green beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507bf2bafce28d3c35d8c35-97702a2c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the rice has 15 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and green beans, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a bowl. Season with salt and pepper and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507bf2bafce28d3c35d8c35-029ea7f2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, add vegetable gyoza in batches, flat-side down, in a single layer. Cook until gyoza base is starting to brown, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water (for the gyoza) and cover with a lid or foil.\n• Cook until water has evaporated and gyoza are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm. TIP: Watch out! The water may spatter!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507bf2bafce28d3c35d8c35-4588d48a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook ginger paste until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in katsu paste, coconut milk and the brown sugar until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes. Remove pan from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507bf2bafce28d3c35d8c35-18e2e7b4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn rice between bowls. Top with veggies and veggie gyoza.\n• Spoon over katsu curry sauce.\n• Garnish with pickled ginger to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507bf2bafce28d3c35d8c35-7a7e3133.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
